1
00:00:00,266 --> 00:00:01,633
I have nothing right now

2
00:00:02,366 --> 00:00:05,800
I know, that's why I chose you

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,100
Since Miss Su said the wedding continues

4
00:00:12,633 --> 00:00:13,633
I'll play along

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,233
Continue the ceremony

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,233
Weren't we at the vows just now

7
00:00:19,366 --> 00:00:20,366
Continue

8
00:00:21,166 --> 00:00:22,266
A wedding is not a game

9
00:00:22,833 --> 00:00:25,266
You should say that to yourself first

10
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,000
I'm not trying to embarrass you

11
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:28,566
I just want you to see clearly

12
00:00:28,666 --> 00:00:30,233
You're not my only option

13
00:00:31,633 --> 00:00:33,100
Are you willing to stand by my side

14
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,400
And finish this wedding

15
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:38,800
I am

16
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,413
Does this need confirmation

17
00:00:40,413 --> 00:00:41,233
from both parents

18
00:00:42,266 --> 00:00:43,200
No need

19
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:44,600
You just made me sign the annulment

20
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,400
statement, which you all agreed to

21
00:00:46,766 --> 00:00:48,033
Since I have called off the engagement

22
00:00:48,066 --> 00:00:50,433
Who I choose now is my own business

23
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,166
Fair enough

24
00:00:52,166 --> 00:00:53,000
If Mr Gu can change his bride

25
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,166
Of course she can change her groom

26
00:00:54,166 --> 00:00:55,066
Are you sure you won't regret this

27
00:00:55,633 --> 00:00:57,100
What I fear isn't regret

28
00:00:57,866 --> 00:00:58,633
Then what is it

29
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:00,000
It's knowing who is worth choosing
